  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e108431957630146b3577b7b306693b, type: 3}
  m_Name: OnScoreChanged
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntGameEvent
  enableDebugLogs: 0
  description: 'Raised when score changes. Passes the amount added/subtracted (positive
    or negative).


    Common Listeners:

    - ScoreUI: Update displayed score
    value

    - ComboSystem: Track kills within time window for multiplier

    -
    AudioManager: Play score increase sound (pitch based on combo)

    - AchievementManager:
    Check score milestones for unlocks

    - HighScoreManager: Check if new high
    score achieved

    - ParticleManager: Spawn "+100" floating text at score source

    -
    DifficultyManager: Scale difficulty based on current score

    - LeaderboardManager:
    Update real-time position on leaderboard


    Use Case:

    Pass the CHANGE
    amount, not the total score. Examples:

    - Enemy killed worth 100 points:
    Raise(100)

    - Pickup collected worth 50 points: Raise(50)

    - Death penalty
    -200 points: Raise(-200)'
